c{\\pi }{2},\\frac{1}{4})$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$  $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the point $(\\frac{1}{4},-\\frac{\\pi }{2})$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$\n\n- Finally, we consider the point $(1,\\pi ).$ We note the following:\n\n- The point $(\\pi ,1)$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$  $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the point $(1,\\pi )$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283798 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283799 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283800 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283801 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283802 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1041 "selection" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283801 13194139534344 true] [17592186283797 1110 #uuid "c48764ef-6fb9-579d-95d9-5fdc4b4c777b" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283798 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283798 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534344 true] [17592186283798 1111 #uuid "4d8389ce-ae7d-5fea-abb6-fc9a00b2c4e5" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283799 1034 "I only" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283799 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534344 true] [17592186283799 1111 #uuid "e76dd8f5-9bf3-5c3a-b1bc-caad25f6f5ec" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283800 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283800 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534344 true] [17592186283800 1111 #uuid "623834c3-b8e6-590e-b111-d763db5bb9c3" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283801 1034 "None of those listed" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283801 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534344 true] [17592186283801 1111 #uuid "ad670d5c-c4d0-5651-b6c2-0e057f4afcdb" 13194139534344 true] [17592186283802 1034 "II only" 1